{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_04_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e3b6304f56e20142af847b60eb087c50d3a9b8dcc7d4937fc3c49e76b470ed0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41eac2f77389c9d6cfbe2fa7dc16bdd8ff8371f0cb83f23d926d7c4234f79992",
      "text": "那个人，可能是我之前递了名片\n并邀请过的那位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0f07f98b6ee2a60a974c4f1ea4fe29ca97cf8485aacc52de8e9dd8af8d57088",
      "text": "贤君。不好意思，\n接下来的事情可以拜托你吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a39c9e7a8335a4002cd6c200c6274ca1fb7b4e18b3f23dbf09b621f0e259bb5",
      "text": "我想再去见一次那位男性！\n所以，这两位就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea0a5d4325086d468fa8005c5e943dff4fa5ffe5ffac84985becc741ec80485a",
      "text": "那个，我也能跟着一起去吗～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:545d26ac4b364ee603fc4a330b1653fde8073a02aa8a38c50c6c400f985300f3",
      "text": "说不定，我也要和那个人\n一起共事了呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee0f65c10309524e9c90db855c64527fe027940e9bc8edc14e36ab647352b83b",
      "text": "既然这样，我也想了解下对方是个什么样的人呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa1d27031d7f5a01728c9fc5236140ea75f0d73ef3e63261a1e556cbb7ecb3e8",
      "text": "正如想乐所言。\n制作人，请务必也让我同行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7019e65b1177d2c78ec1ac61b20f4387e17f08cdaf4501a71b6aa0ba7d53cc8e",
      "text": "……哎呀哎呀，总算收拾完了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9b818b1b60bfdab5364847ca3b2e8753185e27cc43695e42d83364b69190e50",
      "text": "是的。请问您对偶像的工作有兴趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:796a7a888e8e9a7bcba202c87d290d6ebff1e2323d509d3624ddfd5a1423c2a9",
      "text": "我们近期要举办试镜。\n如果有兴趣的话，请务必来参加！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff001bb06246f375e4437b03008edf3d75b7c210c8569013be1eb8dd724e7f31",
      "text": "（本来打算参加今天的份的……\n这个时间的话，肯定已经结束了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ffae924d77bd95f5cb15a2d532b45c780e468b108110cf0aaaf7e183b83d56",
      "text": "（算了，半路上发现了污垢的话，\n那也是没办法的事。看来跟这家事务所无缘……嗯？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_g:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8cf599bdf7d06b5f3193fb633232b8bdaa34d12f74f5025558cfbf0fa1f84f0",
      "text": "你们几位是……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
